🟢 2. Introduction (Write this in report)
Writing

This project demonstrates how to deploy and host a static website using Amazon Web Services (AWS). The workflow includes uploading files to Amazon S3, transferring them to an EC2 instance, and hosting the content over HTTP using a web server.

The objective is to understand cloud storage, virtual servers, and deployment processes in AWS. This project provides hands-on experience with services like Amazon S3 and Amazon EC2.

