🟢 11. Step 7: Copy File from S3 to EC2
💻 Command:
aws s3 cp s3://your-bucket-name/your-file.html .

OR for full folder:

aws s3 sync s3://your-bucket-name /var/www/html/
🟢 12. Step 8: Move Files to Web Directory
sudo cp your-file.html /var/www/html/index.html
🟢 13. Step 9: Start Hosting (HTTP)

Now open browser:

http://your-ec2-public-ip

🎉 Your website will be live!

